course: dictionary
lesson: 395
title: Words with a tech meaning
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words have one meaning in an ordinary dictionary but a more specific meaning in a new setting. Read the words around the word to find which meaning fits. «Open the app and tap the map» tells you that an app is something you open on a screen.
explain: An app is short for «application». It is a program on a phone, tablet or computer, like a game, a map or a calculator. You can add an app, which is called downloading, and take it away, which is called deleting.
explain: Context clues help you check. «Apps help with maps, weather and school work» shows that apps are useful tools that do jobs. To test your meaning, swap in "a program on a phone" and see whether the sentence still makes sense.
fact: An app is a program on a phone, tablet or computer.
fact: App is short for «application».
fact: You can download an app, open it, or delete it.
fact: «Apps let children record the animals and plants they see.»
fact: «Some apps use pretend feelings, like a "sad" AI friend, to keep you using them.» This shows that not every app is simply helpful.
exercise: Read: «Open the app and tap the map.» What is an app? | *A program on a phone, tablet or computer | A small animal that lives in water | A piece of fruit | A type of weather
exercise: What does «delete an app» mean? | Adding it to your phone | Opening it to play | *Taking it away from your phone | Buying a brand new phone
exercise: App is short for which longer word? | *application | approach | apple | apartment
test: «Apps let children record the animals and plants they see.» What does record mean here? | *Keep a note or photo of | Erase | Sing about | Lose
test: «How cold it is can be checked with a window, a thermometer or a weather app; one person's feeling is not the measurement.» Why is a weather app listed as a way to check? | It is a feeling | *It gives a measurement, not just a feeling | It is a window | It makes the weather change
exam: Maya says, «My app tells me the weather.» Which clue shows what an app does? | My | *It tells me the weather | Maya | says
